ntial improvement in a person's looks, and the verb ascend is used for someone undertaking one. Looksmax.org has many threads titled with the word, including plans, protocols with promised before-and-after photos, and long progress updates [1][2][3].","The term is not a procedure, product or theory. Posts show members using it for outcomes reached through body-fat loss, among other routes, and for emotional reactions to looking better; one poster describes crying from joy after losing weight and no longer feeling subhuman, a framing other members questioned [1]. A thread titled to the effect that ascension will not cure psychological issues shows the community also debates its limits [4]."],"infobox":[["Type","Community slang / outcome term"],["Usage","Looksmax.org threads: ascension plans, protocols, updates"],["Related terms","Glow-up, looksmaxxing"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["Members use ascension both as a noun for the change itself and as a goal-setting frame, as in threads named for an ascension plan with a target year [5]. The scope of what counts varies from a single change such as weight loss to multi-year plans."],"subs":[]},{"h":"In looksmaxxing culture","paras":["Threads include requests for ratings after changes, protocol posts promising before-and-after photos, and reflective posts on the emotions of ascending [1][2][3][4]. The reflective thread cited here treats emotional release as a sign of a significant change, and a reply suggests the poster's weight loss may have influenced his mood [1].","Not all discussion is positive: at least one thread argues that ascension does not resolve psychological problems [4]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found. Ascension is a slang label rather than an intervention, so there is no trial of it as such."],"subs":[]}],"lore":{"intro":"Members use the term for appearance outcomes and the emotional meaning attached to them [1][4].","claims":[{"claim":"A successful ascension is accompanied by strong emotion and reflection on one's past self.","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"Ascension does not fix psychological problems.","verdict":"unknown","note":""}]},"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"ascension emotions (looksmax.org)","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/ascension-emotions.1803838/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2025,"type":"forum"},{"title":"ascension protocol will post before and afters (looksmax.org)","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/ascension-protocol-will-post-before-and-afters.1764379/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2025,"type":"forum"},{"title":"ascension update month 5 progress general talk (looksmax.org)","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/ascension-update-month-5-progress-general-talk-and-the-understanding-i-gained-from-my-experience.1651698/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2024,"type":"forum"},{"title":"ascension will never cure your psychological issues (looksmax.org)","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/ascension-will-never-cure-your-psychological-issues.1759355/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2025,"type":"forum"},{"title":"ascension plan now 2027 (looksmax.org)","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/ascension-plan-now-2027.1757266/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2025,"type":"forum"}],"studies":[],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Ascension","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/ascension.2407394/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260926142026/https://looksmax.org/threads/ascension.2407394/"},{"title":"ascension emotions","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/ascension-emotions.1803838/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260308203024/https://looksmax.org/threads/ascension-emotions.1803838/"},{"title":"Ascension behind bars","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/ascension-behind-bars.1784578/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260202195256/https://looksmax.org/threads/ascension-behind-bars.1784578/"},{"title":"ascension plan","url"